  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Neighborhood Upgrading Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Mejoramiento de Barrios</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general es el mejoramiento de la vivienda y el entorno urbano de familias de bajos ingresos viviendo en reas marginales.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective is to improve the housing and urban conditions for low-income groups living in marginal areas. Basic infrastructure and social services will be provided and the beneficiaries properties will be regularized, integrating these areas socially and urbanistically to the formal city.</narrative>
  </description>
